\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A man reminisces about his highschool experience and a girl}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A man is going to meet a girl in his university. The whole novel is a flashback of him before he meet the girl. The man is an ambitious person studying in UI.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The theme is AMBITION.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If you are so ambtious, you get NADIA. She is neurotic, driven, and she has no time to smell the roses. Once she do, she immediately cut back to her chase, she don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t want to be Mediocre.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 If you are not so ambitious, you get DHARMA. He is passive, reactive. He has all the time to smell the roses. Attend concerts, hang out with friends. He chases over nothing, and has all the time in his life.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A romance where the Love Interest did fall for you, but she loves another, she loves her passion more than you.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Challenge in Romances:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Romances are mostly dialogue, and drive of a character to one another, if poorly executed, audience will be screaming in anger \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93WHY THE FUCK DO THEY NOT DATE ALREADY\u8221\'94 but if excessively executed, it will be a cliche ridden story that everyone has ever seen.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Also THTS is a Performance Fiction. Where Dharma and Nadia will be playing a duet at the end of the book, a duet is an auditory and visual thing, how the fuck do I make it work in written form?}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Premise:}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 An average, good for nothing boy meets a girl with an ambitious girl, he is forced to follow her lead. Worst of yet, he fell in love with her.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 What is Nadia\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s ambition?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Nadia is poorer than Dharma. Her father was out of job, and is doing odd jobs, she intend to land herself a scholarship for her university in Spain. That is why she is learning so much harder.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Premise : }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A story of a man who fall in love with a girl who will never love him the same way he did.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0  Designing Principle :}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 An awakening. The girl loves him back by waking him up, she makes him love himself rather than her first, making him chase for what he truly desire without fear.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 DHARMA has father that is constantly berrating him about school and University, and always brags to him that he is in UI with a scholarship. And then he got into a good and prospering career, a healthy job. Maybe at the first few novels he just take everything in. And at the middle DHARMA is so fed up, he took on his father\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s Challenge. DHARMA is going to get accepted in UI and prove him wrong.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In this case, NADIA is the antagonist of the novel.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 But how to make NADIA the antagonist whilst still making her loveable? Still making her the love interest for DHARMA?}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 DHARMA fights NADIA over the proof that he is worthy to be with her in the duet.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 DHARMA\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s basic action is to PROOF. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A young man proves himself that he is worthy and has a drive.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 DHARMA is passive and reactive due to his previledge, he don\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t have to worry for money and stability, and he will be supported up until he go to university, so there is no rush in his life.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 His struggle to PROOF himself comes from that passivity, that there is nothing to worry about, comes NADIA. Who is everything but that. She is ambitious because she have to be ambitious. Her father is laid off, her mother sickly, her savings are up until University. If she fails, she won\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t able to go to Universtiy anymore, she will probably go to a nursing school, which she don\u8217\'92t want. She wants to go to a Universty and that means applying to numerous Scholarships, and hoping for the best, and being the best that she can.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The result of this few months being in close proximity with a person like NADIA is that it made DHARMA has a drive. At first it\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s just NADIA challenging him to nail a line, a difficult line, and eventually it\u8217\'92s her asking him about his life.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 What does DHARMA wants or passionate about?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 DHARMA is passionate about animals, he loves cats, and all sort of animals. This makes him wants to take Veterinary Medicine in UI}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A PASSIVE, good for nothing man, is paired with an over-achieving girl for a duet contest, discovers his passion and drive for life.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Maybe DHARMA was invited to NADIA\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s house after one session when he accompanies her home, and her parents asks him to stay for dinner. Since probably NADIA talks a lot about him, and in that dinner, when NADIA gets out first, that is when he learns about NADIA\u8217\'92s family situation, maybe that is what drives him to find his Drive and purpose.         }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0}